pohoda-abo-importer (1.0.1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Static Debian autoloader, composer is no longer needed at build or runtime
  * Depends on php-spojenet-abo-parser and php-vitexsoftware-pohoda-connector
  * Fixed bin/pohoda-abo-importer path and package contents (no vendor/.env)
  * multiflexi package imports the app definition with multiflexi-cli

