pohoda-abo-importer (1.0.0) jammy; urgency=medium

  * Initial release
  * ABO bank statement parser implementation 
  * Pohoda mServer integration with duplicate detection
  * JSON report generation with MultiFlexi schema compliance
  * Command-line interface with configurable options
  * Comprehensive error handling and logging

